{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/hashicorp/tfc-agent","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:05:23.838Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/hashicorp/tfc-agent/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/hashicorp/tfc-agent"},"readme":"Terraform Cloud Agent\n=====================\n\nThe Terraform Cloud Agent handles auxiliary workloads for [Terraform Cloud](https://app.terraform.io). Agents connect to the Terraform Cloud API and process work items, allowing specific components such as Terraform plans and applies to run in external infrastructure, rather than on HashiCorp-hosted servers. This enables placing Terraform Cloud workloads in any network context desired.\n\nFurther information may be found on the [Terraform Cloud Agents](https://www.terraform.io/docs/cloud/workspaces/agent.html) documentation page.\n\nDetailed usage information may be obtained by pulling the container and running it with the \"help\" subcommand. Example:\n```\ndocker run hashicorp/tfc-agent:latest help\n```","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"hashicorp","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/hashicorp","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2020-08-11T18:21:29.384758Z","updated":"2026-09-22T18:25:00.070206Z","categories":["Networking","Security","Integration & delivery"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":175750542,"stars":15},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":39734165681,"tags":[{"name":"1.32","digest":"sha256:c6403aa6d5e99826d1f2c3e8e364b118e62ef26b3c12a9976054e10b8718e9a5","pushed":"2026-09-22T18:24:59.695883Z","size":351542590,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/arm64","linux/s390x"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:c6403aa6d5e99826d1f2c3e8e364b118e62ef26b3c12a9976054e10b8718e9a5","pushe